WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Create an account
Validation helps correct a form before creating an ordinary user account.

2
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:16.130
Make the profile yours
Display name and bio save together; photo changes save immediately.

3
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:23.630
Choose what to share
A private profile hides listening activity from another signed-in user.

4
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:31.130
Privacy across sessions
The viewer sees the privacy boundary rather than hidden activity.

5
00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:38.630
Return to a public profile
Privacy can be changed again by the profile owner.

6
00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:46.130
Sign out and sign back in
Signing out clears the app session; signing in restores the user account.

7
00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:53.630
Recovery is explicitly unavailable
This deployment needs an email relay; it does not claim a reset email was sent.

8
00:00:53.630 --> 00:01:01.130
An invalid reset link has a next step
A missing reset token directs the user back to recovery or sign-in.

9
00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:11.530
Album administration
Existing catalogue records are visible; creation validates fields without saving a new album.

10
00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:23.130
Song metadata and file controls
The editor supports artist, genre, album, cover and audio selection. Changes are canceled.

11
00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:31.330
Artist artwork and biography
Artist creation/editing controls are demonstrated without changing existing performers.

12
00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:38.830
Account management
Account emails are redacted; role and deletion prompts are canceled.

13
00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:46.330
Administrator controls are separate
The administrators screen has its own account creation and role controls. No privileges are changed.
